window.products.push({"id":370156,"name":"Prestige Home Fashion Thermal Insulated Blackout Curtain - Antique Bronze Grommet Top - Charcoal - 38\"W x 96\"L, 1 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9192gtK9NiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring warmth and style to your home with high-quality insulated blackout window curtain pair. The grommet top adds a modern touch and provides energy efficient comfort. It features innovative fabric construction. Compare to the other curtains, our product is extremely soft and drapery. The sophisticated designs allow you to decorate your windows with great styles. Never compare our blackout curtains with those cheap ones that are stiff and looks like a shower curtain. Blackout is perfect for : late sleepers shift workers seniors infants and parents students computer operators care instruction : -machine wash warm with like colors. -Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. -Tumble dry low. -Warm iron as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9192gtK9NiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prestige Home Fashion","source_asin":"B01DE8LD28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DE8LD28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DE8LD28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370157,"name":"Walensee King Seersucker Comforter Set 100% Polyester Soft Washable Microfiber Bed Comforters with 2 Pillowshams, Lightweight Cozy Bedding Comforter S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l8pMCgzXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHIC SEERSUCKER DESIGN: The seersucker comforter sets with a slight pleat, and is smooth on the reverse. The unique seersucker design with a slight pleat brings a vivid three-dimensional wavy pattern visual effect that is more textured, elegant, and refined, creating a dreamy atmosphere. Also, it's a good gift choice for friends or families. You will feel comfortable sleeping all night with the Walensee seersucker comforters. 100% POLYESTER MICROFIBER FABRIC: Walensee seersucker comforter set is made of 100% high-quality polyester microfiber fabric on the front, and high-density brushed microfiber fabric on the reverse, which is smooth and soft, skin-friendly and breathable, ensuring an excellent sleeping experience. Solid stitching for the comforter largely improves its durability, well-preventing bunching and creates a lightweight comforter for year-round comforts. LIGHTWEIGHT and SOFT: The well-finished fabric material provides smooth and comfortable touching. Filled with 280 GSM 100% polyester, is made of high quality material which makes the filling is more soft and fluffy, provides exceptional warmth and cozy, it also offers feeling of cloud-like and breathability which keeps you warm for all seasons. The special stitching design prevents shifting and clumping of the filling in the bedding comforter set, improving its durability for long-term use. PACKAGE and SIZE: Walensee comforter set with three sizes: Twin size seersucker comforter set includes 2 pieces : 1 comforter (68\"x90\"), 1 standard sham (20\"x26\"). Queen size seersucker comforter set includes 3 pieces: 1 comforter (90\"x90\"), 2 standard shams (20\"x26\"). King size seersucker comforter set includes 3 pieces : 1 comforter (104\"x90\"), 2 King shams (20\"x36\"). MACHINE WASHABLE AND EASY CARE: Support machine washable in the gentle cycle with cold water separately. Air dry or tumble dry on low heat. Do not bleach. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact Walensee. Tips: Due to the comforter sets being packed in a vacuum bag, please lay the comforter set flat after opening the package, and use it after 24 hours, or you can expose it to sunlight and tap gently, then it will fluff up nicely after hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l8pMCgzXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walensee","source_asin":"B0B7L828PR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7L828PR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7L828PR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370158,"name":"Kitsune Nine-Tailed Fox Wood Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BOpDe1woL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"HOLIDAY CHEER TO SHARE: Put your own spin on holiday traditions with our heirloom-quality ornaments. Available in a variety of themes and fandoms, these colorful ornaments have a personal, hand-made feel and make versatile holiday decorations. GENUINE MAPLE VENEER: Crafted from natural-finish wood, our ornaments are printed on one side with the festive design shown. Unlike glass bulbs, our ornaments are shatterproof, making them perfect for families with kids or pets. Hanging cord included. Dimensions 3.0\" (7.6 cm) x 3.6\" (9.1 cm). FUN FOR KIDS, TEENS AND ADULTS: Suitable for all ages, these durable ornaments are great for accenting Christmas decorations, personalizing for loved ones, gift swaps, or just admiring. Perfect as holiday party favors, goodie bag fillers, team gifts, or anyone on your Nice list. All creative internal designs apply. In other words unlicensed. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BOpDe1woL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B081B8NVRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081B8NVRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081B8NVRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370159,"name":"CHAMPS Stovetop Griddle & Grill Pan - Reversible, Non-Stick, Two Burner Cast Aluminum Stove Top Griddle - Grease Trap, Dual Handles, Dishwasher Safe -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R6kyxzdbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REVERSIBLE DESIGN: This grill & griddle has double sides, so you can cook on both sides simultaneously. On one side, you have a flat griddle, that is perfect for cooking pancakes or sandwiches and the other side is ribbed which is great for grilling steaks or veggies. PREMIUM NON-STICK COATING: This stone cookware is made of cast aluminum, a long-lasting material that makes brilliant cookware. Strong and durable, this kitchen tool features a 100% PFOA-free non-stick coating that helps you cook healthier meals while being easy to clean. This grill & griddle pan resists scratching and peeling to ensure continued use. SMART PERFORMANCE: This innovative unit fits over two stovetop burners and provides excellent heat retention and distribution, resulting in consistent, even cooking. Use it to sear, sauté, bake, broil, or grill. It's safe to use in the oven, on the stove, on the grill, or over a campfire. This item is dishwasher safe, allowing you to save time on clean up in the kitchen between uses EASY TO USE: The expansive 19.5” x 11” cooking surface allows you to use this product to make an entire meal for a family. And the diagonal patterns of grooves on the grill side drain off fat while creating the signature look and texture of grilling. For added convenience, we have introduced ergonomic handles on our grill /griddle pans that will make flipping, lifting, and hanging storage easy. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Our goal is to win your repeat business and your good word by providing the best possible customer service. If you have any problems with this product, please contact us. We will do our best to make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R6kyxzdbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHAMPS","source_asin":"B09ZFDHXJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZFDHXJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZFDHXJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
