window.products.push({"id":370188,"name":"Unity Candles for Wedding Ceremony Set - Wedding Candles, Rustic Wedding Decorations for Ceremony Outside, White Unity Candle Set Just Married Candle ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dtjVacuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lighting a Unity Candle The lighting of a unity candle isn't based in any particular faith, but the practice has become more and more common in modern wedding ceremonies. Lighting a Unity Candle during your wedding ceremony is a special way to symbolize joining together. How does the unity candle work? Decorated candles are also beautiful additions to receptions and other events celebrating love.The unity candle is lit by the bride and groom from two separate family candles, representing the union of your families. Often your mothers light the family candles, and then you two each hold your family's candle to light the unity candle together. But your dads can be in on it, too. When is the Unity Candle Lit? Usually the unity candle is lit directly after you exchange vows. Can the two sets of parents light it, and then the bride and groom use it to light theirs? If it is important to you for both sets of parents to be involved in the wedding unity candle ceremony, by all means, include everyone. Where Does the Wedding Unity Candle Tradition Come From? Unity candle ceremonies are relatively new. Symbolically, flames are said to represent the love and passion each partner has for the other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dtjVacuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIKEYO","source_asin":"B0BQD84DF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQD84DF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQD84DF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370189,"name":"HAUS AND HUES Nature Wall Art Prints Landscape Mountain Decor Mid Century Art Wall Decor, Geometric Abstract Nature Wall Art, Mountain Art Wall Decor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7103-NMbcnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MID CENTURY ART WALL DECOR: Inspired by the clean minimalist lines and bright colors of mid century decor, this modern mountain wall art set from Haus and Hues has a timeless appeal that blends well with most home decor. Each mountain painting brings out a strong connection to nature with its varying shades of blue, yellow and orange, creating an effortlessly fresh and vintage mix GALLERY QUALITY ART: Our set of 4 mountain posters include a mix of Nordic forest wall art printed on semi-gloss paper. Similar to our national parks posters, we reinforce all landscape prints and posters with chipboard pads and ship them in rigid stay-flat mailers to make sure that you receive blemish-free artwork that you originally envisioned. Frame these nature posters side by side with our national parks wall art set to create a gallery wall or hang them separately to cover more spaces QUALITY GUARANTEED: Buy Haus and Hues mountain posters online with confidence. We spend countless hours designing, reviewing and assessing every aspect of each art print we create to ensure that you receive high quality artwork that rivals even curated gallery pieces. If you are not happy with your purchase, contact us and we’ll happy to offer a full refund or replacement CONTEMPORARY TAKE: A timeless set that can evolve constantly with ever changing decor, this nature wall art set goes well with different themes, such as scandinavian, nordic, abstract and traditional. Our modern wall art designs are lightfast and long-lasting, so you can be sure to enjoy these beautiful landscape posters for years AN AESTHETIC GIFT: Give a great gift for the people you care about. Haus and Hues prints make for a perfect gift for a housewarming party, anniversary, birthday, and just about any occasion. These landscape mid century prints are a memorable gift that shows your flair for gift giving and consideration for the recipient’s taste and style. They arrive unframed, so the person you’re giving them to can choose the perfect frame that match their interior setting","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7103-NMbcnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B08TC6TRBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TC6TRBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TC6TRBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
