window.products.push({"id":370224,"name":"Root Candles Unscented Timberline Collenette 5-Inch Dinner Candles, Box of 8, Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YEPG9b5NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These USA-made Timberline Collenette Dinner Candles have a wide 1. 25-Inches diameter with a 7/8-Inch tapered base to fit into any fine dinner candle holder. The Timberline finish resembles the smooth weathered bark of a tree, capturing the bold spirit of the great outdoors. Root Candles' Timberline Collenette candles burn an impressive 2-1/2 hours per inch and are available in a designer palette of 14 year round colors and 8 seasonal colors that rotate throughout the year. Available in a wide variety of lengths - 5, 7, and 9-Inch. Root Candles is an iconic American company that traces its lineage back to 1869 when founder Amos Ives Root first opened his doors for business in Medina, Ohio. Since then, 5 generations of Root candle-makers have created the best candles in America. Using all-natural materials for purity and balance, Root Candles seduce your senses, enhance your living space and soothe your soul. Candles are manufactured according to all ASTM (safety) standards. Root manufactures their own all-natural cotton wicks and test burns 1, 000 candles every day to check fragrance throw, emissions, soot, flame strength, stability, useful life, welling, dripping, and burn time. Stringent color matching is done daily to ensure consistent quality from batch to batch. Root has combined the time-honored methods of early 20th century hand crafted candle-making, with 21st century automation technologies to continue a renowned tradition and reputation. Every Root Candle is made in the USA, on the same plot of land Amos Ives Root, purchased over 100 years ago. The results are pure and simple: Root Candles are highly regarded for complex bouquets of subtle fragrances and sophisticated color palettes. Today, Root Candles continues traditional standards of superior candle craftsmanship while introducing vibrant new textures, brilliant new colors, complex and intriguing new fragrances, and innovative, modern designs to their collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YEPG9b5NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Root Candles","source_asin":"B07S45782Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S45782Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S45782Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
