window.products.push({"id":370261,"name":"Regal Flame Delano Ventless Free Standing Bio Ethanol Fireplace Can Be Used as a Indoor, Outdoor, Gas Log Inserts, Vent Free, Electric, Outdoor Firepl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617dVCFAK7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Delano Ventless Free Standing Ethanol Fireplace. Delano modern ethanol fireplace is designed to reflect purity, simplicity and perfect for any indoor and outdoor setting. It is composed mostly of glass, allowing the natural element of the flame to boast proudly as its centerpiece. Tempered glass is used to support the burner and as a protective barrier from the flame, with four steel legs it allows the fireplace to to levitate as a floating fire. Regal Flame indoor fireplaces do not require any installation or utility connection for fuel supply which makes it ideal for almost any architectural environment. This fireplace is idea for condo, apartment, single family home, restaurants and hotels. The fireplaces are fueled by a renewable modern energy named denatured ethanol, which burns free, emits no fumes, environmentally friendly and is virtually maintenance free. Insert Type and Capacity: 1 x 1.5 Liter Dual Layer Burner made of 430 Stainless Steel. Type: Free Standing Fireplace. Use Indoor or Outdoor. Recommend for Condo, Apartment, Family Home, Office, Restaurants and Hotels. What is Included: Fireplace - x1, Ethanol Burner Insert (1.5 Liter) - x1, Damper Tool - x1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617dVCFAK7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Regal Flame","source_asin":"B01N5UHTK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N5UHTK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N5UHTK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370262,"name":"BIGMONAT Hand Washing Timer for Kids, Musical Teeth Brushing Timer for Boy and Girl, Stick on Bathroom Timer for Children Training Coach, AAA Battery ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LM9TSeYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Musical Hand Washing (20 Seconds) 1. Press the \"hand\" wash button, the lens will illuminate green and blink and the song will ring. 2. Start washing your hands.  3. The light will blink faster as the action of hand washing progress.  4. The light will turn red when time is up and the music will stop. Musical Teeth Brushing (2 Minutes) 1.Press the \"tooth\" brush button, the lens will illuminate green and blink and the song will ring. 2. Start brushing your teeth.  3. The light will blink faster as the action of brushing teeth progress.  4. The light will turn red when time is up and the music will stop. * Use hook and loop tape to fix the bracket in place, the \"timer\" is easy slide in or slide out from the bracket.  Great Gift Of Training Coach Timer - It is prefect to help children develop a good habit of personal hygiene. Packing List - 1 x Wash hand and tooth brush timer - 2 x Suction cups  - 1 x Hook and loop tape  - 2 x Screw - 1 x User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LM9TSeYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIGMONAT","source_asin":"B083L9Z6LW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083L9Z6LW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083L9Z6LW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
