window.products.push({"id":370269,"name":"CYS EXCEL Glass Apothecary Jar. H-13.5\", Body-11\" Decorative Candy Buffet Jar, Elegant Glass Storage Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u5Je9CONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"13.5\" Tall Vintage Apothecary Jar   DIMENSION: Height-13.5\", Open D-5.75\", Body D-11\", Base D-6.5\"   Purpose: Home Decor, Storage, Preserve, Buffet   Apothecary Jar-History Apothecary is also known as professional medicine. Many doctors require storage units. Glass jars are exceptional because it doesn’t bend or move and provides an ideal barrier against exposure. However, they needed to classify the medical items as being stored-solid, liquid, and pills/capsules. in which one of those methods is changing the shape and size of the jar. Crafters hand-blow Apothecary jars into different sizes and shapes, but to attract buyers, they become more and more beautiful. With the unique designs of the jars, and the change in the way people store their medicine. Apothecary jars are seen less in medicine but more in people's houses and events as Glass Decoration storage units.  Apothecary Jar-Modern Decor Event planners love to use these to store food for people. Not only are they able to hold a large amount of food, but the lids can keep the food warm while denying any dust or critters that might be interested in the food within. The unique design on these jars will attract many that catches sight of it. Made with transparent glass material, it displays all the beautiful items within. As if it's asking you to put your hand inside to grab hold of all the treasures inside.  Straight-forward Design Do not let the circular body fool you. These jars can hold a significant amount of candy inside, with a lid that fits perfectly on top and a simple yet artistic knob. It is not only perfect for keeping items inside safe but also provides easy access for those needing to obtain the things inside. Regardless if you are choosing those with a long or without a long stem. They will add a modern yet elegant feel to the event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u5Je9CONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CYS EXCEL","source_asin":"B08CPND1TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CPND1TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CPND1TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
