window.products.push({"id":370341,"name":"Handcrafted Bread Storage Box - Wooden Bread Box - Farmhouse Decorative Bread Box Made with Natural Birch Bark","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712EpH+1USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform the Meaning of Bread Storage with this Vintage Decorative Bread Box! Expertly handcrafted with love, this bespoke bread storage box will make an asset to any kitchen. Able to hold a wide variety of bread types and baked goods with ease, this versatile bread bin is both unique and practical. Keeps Bread Safe and Fresher for Longer Birch Bark has been hailed for its impressive hygienic properties. This bread box is also able to absorb excess moisture to keep nasties at bay. Your bread will remain soft, fresh, and in perfect condition for much longer than if stored in a standard metal alternative. Retro Vintage Style This vintage bread bin is the ultimate statement maker. Perfect if you prefer a more rustic kitchen style, eyes are sure to be drawn to the rich design of this storage box. It makes the perfect gift too! Easy to Care For The natural properties of Birch Bark means this bread box is super easy to take care of. If dirty, simply wipe clean with a soft damp cloth and leave to air dry. Avoid storing in the sun for long periods of time, and don’t attempt to wash using a dishwasher. Enhance Your Kitchen and Bread Storage – Get Your Vintage Bread Box Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712EpH+1USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R&Z","source_asin":"B08CCNZYHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CCNZYHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CCNZYHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370342,"name":"Aqua Circumstance Wall Decor by Color Bakery, 18\" x 18\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91I1hIEcrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a blue whether it's trend-right dinnerware collections, fabric, hostess-ware and home decor accents, gift items, wall decor or paper goods, color bakery is unusually diversified when it comes to designing in widely varying styles and art genres. From repeat patterns to botanical to coastal and kitchen (food) art, color bakery is synonymous with diversity--coupled with an impressive track record of success. No matter what the assignment, they work closely with art licensing international's clients to create exclusive, custom designs that are painstakingly mindful of brand. They even create mock-ups with the customer's own product photography. And that kind of rare, personalized customization translates into sales. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91I1hIEcrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00VLIVNZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VLIVNZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VLIVNZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
