window.products.push({"id":370360,"name":"Hangon Combo Set Recycled Plastic Shirt & Pants Hangers, 17 Inch & 12 Inch, Black, 30 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r-zHDTEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Choosing the right hanger for your clothes may be the most important decision you make when organizing your clothes. If you’re like most people, you have an assortment of clothing hangers that have accumulated throughout the years. Seldom do they match, and even worse your tops and bottoms slip and fall off, ending up on the floor. Your miss-matched hangers are also robbing you of space! Hang On offers the economical, and easy, solution to finally getting your closets organized. Our strong, durable, recycled plastic clothes hangers are ideal for a variety of uses both in the home and in commercial spaces. The chrome swivel hooks easily rotate a full 360 degrees, and slide effortlessly on household closet rods made of wood or metal, and are ideal for retail clothing racks. Unlike velvet hangers, they won’t shed or stain your delicate blouses and slacks, so you can use them for dry cleaning, or wet laundry without worry. This special bundled set comes with both our sturdy shirt hangers and robust pants hangers. The easiest, hassle free, option for reorganizing your closets. The top hangers feature notched arms, great for blouses, blazers, shirts, vests, sundresses, tank tops and more. The bottom hangers have strong pinch grip clips that are perfect for all your bottoms from trousers, jeans, and slacks, to skirts, shorts, and leggings. Available in two sets, the 17 inch top with 12 inch bottom combo are great for Juniors, and Small and Standard Adult sizes. The larger set, which includes 19 inch Top and 14 inch bottoms hangers are fantastic for larger sizes, and a match made in heaven for plus sized clothing. No more dents or creases from poor fitting hangers. Plus, their use and usefulness doesn’t end at your everyday clothing, they’re great for special occasion dresses, gowns, and suits, seasonal costumes, crafts, fabrics and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r-zHDTEFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hangon","source_asin":"B07M79LBYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M79LBYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M79LBYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
