window.products.push({"id":370371,"name":"Pizza Peel, Fewlaush Aluminum Metal Pizza Peel with Foldable Wood Handle for Easy Storage 12-Inch x 14-Inch, Gourmet Luxury Pizza Paddle for Baking Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f7qkEneQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fewlaush Pizza Peel - A perfect pizza set for making delicious pizza. Summary: It’s a perfect metal pizza paddle with folding wooden handle specially crafted for artisan bakers, pizza maker (home and commercial chef). The pizza oven paddle is made of commercial-grade aluminum to withstand high temperatures and durability The beauty of the 11-inch handle is that it can be easily foldable and easy to store. Even the pizza paddle can be hanged through its leather cord. Pizza turning peel is a perfect match for any kitchen decor, gourmet pizza parlor, and bakery. The included 14 inch rocker style pizza cutter makes it easy to cut while maintaining a beautiful pizza shape. Make the perfect pizza at home with a set of Pizza Peel and Rocking Cutter. Assembly and Uses: Insert a screw from the bottom of the peal. Place the handle on top of the screw. Firmly tighten the metallic screw before use. To make the pizza slides easily into peal sprinkle with flour, cornmeal, or milted wheat bran. Place carefully onto a baking sheet, pizza stone, or tray with peel. Once cooked slide out the bread, pizza, or baked goods from the oven using pizza peel with a handle. Care: Hand wash in warm, soapy water. Not dishwasher safe. Scrap off any excess food or crumbs from the peel using a soft sponge. Dry immediately. Use a wooden cutting board for slicing the pizza once ready. Do not slice the pizza directly on the peel. It may damage your knife blade or leave scratches on the peel. Do not leave the pizza peel for a long time in the oven to avoid the wooden handle from burning out. Items included: 1 No. 12\" x 14\" Food grade aluminum blade. 1 No. 11\" All Natural Pine Wood Handle. 1 No. Alloy nut 1 No. 14” Rocker cutter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f7qkEneQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fewlaush","source_asin":"B096BGZBSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096BGZBSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096BGZBSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
