window.products.push({"id":370375,"name":"Valea Home Faux Linen Kitchen Swag Valance Curtains Rustic Rod Pocket Valance Curtain Panels Clearance for Small Window 27 x 38 inches, 2 Panels, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YR75BRBEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Valea Home Semi Sheer Window Curtains work with any home decor. Brighten your kitchen and dining room. Burlap linen look curtain is a stylish way to maintain privacy while infusing any room with natural light. WELL MADE: 3 inch high pole pocket works well with standard rods.  This window curtain is made of durable polyester fabric, adding rustic style to your room. STYLISH & PRIVACY: Faux linen textured design will surely give a airy look to your home.  They are not too heavy but heavy enough to fall nicely.  Rustic valance curtain gives a natural speckled look that blends beautifully with the curtain.  This faux linen valance curtains are very sturdy and let nature light in while providing privacy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YR75BRBEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Valea Home","source_asin":"B0B2J7C1J9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2J7C1J9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2J7C1J9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370376,"name":"Degas - Small Statue - Little Dancer of Fourteen Years (1881)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819AxsxYR+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Established in 1880, Parastone, originally part of the famous art dealership “Borzo” became an independent company in 1963 and devoted itself to producing high quality reproductions of timeless masterpieces for over 50 years. The collection “Mouseion” is devoted to make exact three-dimensional representations of masterpieces. The French Impressionist artist Edgar Degas’ work “La Petite Danseuse de Quatorze Ans”(1881) is represented in this exact small resin statue reproduction including fabric for the skirt and a wooden base where the ballerina stands resting in the fourth ballet position. “La Petite Danseuse de Quatorze Ans”(1881) sculpture was made after Marie van Goethem, a young student of the Paris Opera Ballet, in wax and featuring a real bodice, tutu, ballet slippers and a wig of real hair, where everything but the hair ribbon and the tutu were covered in wax. Although scholarship continues to debate on the exact relationship of the young dancer and Edgar Degas, it is known that it was common for young ballerinas at the Opera during the 1880’s to seek for protectors among the wealthy visitors back stage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819AxsxYR+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parastone","source_asin":"B001A4WWCO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001A4WWCO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001A4WWCO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
