window.products.push({"id":370482,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler, LIFEPLUS Portbale Air Cooling Fan with 3 Modes, Remote Control and 12H Timer，Quiet Bladeless Tower Fan with Independent Humidi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c-QXRLIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 in 1 Evaporative Air Cooler: Lifeplus Evaporative Air Cooler cannot only be used as an tower fan, but also as a humidifier and a swamp cooler which brings you moist wind and cooling down the air around you faster in hot summer. The large-capacity 1.32 gallon water tank reduces the trouble of frequent water filling, It can be used for about 6-hours after filling up the water. If you want the cooler effect, please add ice water or the ice boxes that comes with the package. 3 Speeds&Modes/ Remote Control: This evaporative air conditioner has 3 wind speed（Small/Middle/High）and modes（Natural/Sleeping/Normal）with 360° Oscillation function which can satisfy your various cooling need . This ac fan is very simple to use. In addition to being controlled by buttons, it can also be controlled by remote control from a long distance. You can easily adjust to the mode you want on the sofa or bed. Best company for your summer! Safe Design &Quiet: The bladeless design protects your baby or pets from traditional bladed fan accidents, eliminating your extra worries. Low noise operation is more suitable for kids and the elderly who are more likely to be awakened when sleeping. Energy Saving&12 Hour Timer: Compared to traditional air conditioners, our evaporative cooler consume less electricity. And it does not need to be installed which saves you labor costs. Also the timing function solves the troubles of running the cooling effect overnight which saves your electricity bill. Portable: Lightweight and small wheels make it easy for you to take this bladeless fan anywhere. It is great for offices, living room, bedroom and etc! A good choice of gift for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c-QXRLIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B09MTFSGHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MTFSGHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MTFSGHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
