window.products.push({"id":370525,"name":"ULG 4-Pack Socks Underwear Drawer Organizer Divider, Washable Dresser Drawer Organizer Foldable Oxford Fabric Closet Organizers and Storage Boxes for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bVJnoEtiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👙 Premium Quality Organizer- Different from most non-woven fabric products on the market, our sock organizer is made of Oxford fabric which is machine washable, easy to clean and wear resistant. The mesh compartment is breathable and elastic, making storage more flexible. These drawer organizers are perfect for keeping everything in place. 🧦 4 Boxes in 2 Sizes: This drawer organizer set includes two square boxes (L 12\" x W 12\" x H 4\"each) and two rectangular ones (L 12\" x W 6\" x H 4\"each). The inner storing cubic cells (24 in square box, 7 in rectangular one) are perfect for small items like underwear, socks, briefs, ties, bows, hair clips, jewelry, while the strip bins (8 in square box, 6 in the rectangular one) are great for bra, t-shirt, swimsuits and other larger clothing. 🩲 Durable & Space-saving Drawer Organizers - Made of long-lasting Oxford fabric which is durable and tear-resistant. The storage boxes comes with an EVA pad for supporting making sock organizer strong and not easy to bend or deform. The drawer divider is a great organizer for your closet, drawer, wardrobe, it is all aimed to match your home style neatly and aesthetically. 🧣 Easy to Assemble and Collapse - These drawer organizers are easy to assemble (you just unfold it basically). These 4 drawer dividers also can be folded flat to save space when not in use, keeping in order and biding farewell to clutter. Lightweight for easy carrying, you can even take them with you for sorting during travel. 👓 4 Pack Dresser Organizers - Our 4 pack dresser drawer organizers would keep your various items organized, making it easy and fast to find what you want. These also can be used for organizing cloth diapers and baby stuff on your changing table. They're flexible but sturdy enough to keep the items separated and meet your organizational needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bVJnoEtiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ULG","source_asin":"B09R3VFNRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R3VFNRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R3VFNRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
