window.products.push({"id":370573,"name":"Cottingon Wrap Around Elastic Bed Skirt,Three Sides Fabric, Solid, Easy On/Easy Off Dust Ruffled Bed Skirts,Dust Ruffle Wrap Around Style,Ruffled Wrap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xI-Bj0njS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Stop Wresting with your Mattress! This new idea bed skirt has no platform, no need to lift the heavy mattress, simply wrap it around your bed and done. Easy to put it on and take it off. To most people, changing a bed skirt is a hard work, but this elastic bed skirt makes a hard work become so easy! Save your energy, save your time! A PERFECT FIT: The Cottingon dust Ruffle bed skirt is designed to be a perfect fit for your Twin and Twin-XL sizes beds thanks to the built-in adjustable elastic strap. The bed skirt measures 39\"x75\"x16\" Deep Pocket. LUXURIOUS SILKY SATIN LIKE MICROFIBER FABRIC: This Wrap Around ruffled bed skirt is beautiFully made from 100 percent silky satin-like microfiber fabric softly shirred for a romantic yet tailored look. The fabric is dust and stain resistant, wrinkle free and extremely soft and smooth. SUPER EASY TO PUT ON, DESIGNED TO FIT: Featuring a platform-free easy wrap around stretch & elastic adjustable construction, you can easily put this bed skirt on and off by yourself without lifting the mattress. Suitable for most Types of Beds: Conceals any frames, box springs, platforms, mattresses or underneath storage (But not suitable for beds with footboard or posts) Easy care instructions: made by polyester fabric, simply machine wash. Dries quick on tumble dry low. Wrinkle and Fade Resistant, More durable than cotton.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xI-Bj0njS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottingon","source_asin":"B07Q8RPYTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q8RPYTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q8RPYTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":370574,"name":"Mugzie \"Bahama Pineapple\" Cocktail Shaker with Insulated Wetsuit Cover, 16 oz, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Z6F7J3WL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"No more cold and wet hands. Mugzie brand Cocktail Shakers combine the excellent insulation and water-proof properties of neoprene wetsuit material and the beauty of a stainless steel Cocktail Shaker. The Mugzie' s unique, hand-sewn fabric cover is made from 1/4 inch closed-cell neoprene that is covered with soft, water-proof polyester fabric. The stain-resistant cover is printed in hi-resolution and has full-wrap coverage. The Mugzie has excellent insulating properties to keep beverages hot or cold. The cushioned cover affords a secure grip and eliminates condensation and sweating. Mugzie Cocktail Shaker features a built-in ice strainer as well as a removable lid. The counter-weighted bottom provides stability. Use it for both hot and cold beverages. 16 Ounce Capacity. Features spill-proof removable lid and a non-skid bottom. Hand Wash. Made in the U.S.A. Patented.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612Z6F7J3WL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mugzie","source_asin":"B009OVPAXI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009OVPAXI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009OVPAXI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
