window.products.push({"id":370797,"name":"ALPACA Electric Fireplace Logs Inserts Heater with Infrared Remote Controller 5 Flame Brightness 24h Timer Overheating Protection for Home and Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CfZ0kpw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REALISTIC 3D FAKE FLAME: ALPACA flame light imitates burning logs, presenting a realistic, rolling, and pulsating flame effect. The electric fireplaces adopt exquisite craftsmanship and premium material that can be run independently of heating, you no longer need to haul wood and clean up ashes. ENERGY SAVING FIREPLACE INSERT: Both the flame and temperature can be adjusted independently, there are 5 brightness levels of flame and 2 heating modes for you to choose from, The flame function can be used separately whether the heater is on or off, making this electric logs for fireplace convenient to use in every season. FAN HEATING FUNCTION: It comes with an adjustable fan heater, its function allows you to control the temperature and air humidity in the room. Equipped with remote control, press the heater button once or twice for high and low heating mode. When you press the heater button the 3rd time, the heater will turn off and the fan will continue running for 60 seconds to disperse the remaining heat from inside. The fan does not sound loud so it does not influence you to read, rest, or even sleep. OVERHEAT PROTECTION: For the safety of your family, our fireplace is safely equipped with overheating automatic shutdown function and it is ETL certified, it will automatically cut off the power when overheating, ensuring that you fall asleep warmly and quietly at night without any worries. You can press the timer button to set a timer between 1 to 24 hours, after which the heater will turn on or off by itself. PORTABLE ELECTRIC FIREPLACE LOGS: Plugs into any 120 volts outlet, the electric logs can be placed anywhere you like, it can free standing and built-in installation. It also can be a replacement for a traditional fireplace. Comfortable warmth—a small electric fireplace heater ideal for your living room, bedroom, basement, office, courtyard, or store. YOUR PEACE OF MIND IS OUR PRIORITY: We only make high-quality fireplace products, ALPACA electric fireplaces have passed strict quality inspection before leaving the factory, and have certificates to ensure your peace of mind when buying and using. If you have any problems with your electric fire place, please feel free to contact the ALPACA service team directly and we will get back to you within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CfZ0kpw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpaca","source_asin":"B0BJZGB41J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-370797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZGB41J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZGB41J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
